---
const subtitle = "Sovereign Stack for Neurodivergent Families";
---

<section class="relative pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-32 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase" style="color: var(--p31-accent);">Open Source · Sovereign · Neurodivergent-First</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold leading-tight" style="color: var(--p31-text);">
        {subtitle}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl" style="color: var(--p31-text-secondary);">
        We built the stack. Now you can own it. Sovereign identity, care economy, and open research — all open source, all yours.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-4 pt-4">
        <a href="/signup" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-all" style="background: var(--p31-accent); color: #000;">
          Deploy Your Own
          <span style="font-size: 14px;">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/p31labs/P31-local-workspace" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-all border" style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border); color: var(--p31-text);">
          <span>GitHub</span>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7;">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
